Browser icons
=============

The installer shows each browser's own icon, taken from the package that
ships it, to identify which browser you are choosing. Using a mark to refer
to the product it belongs to is ordinary nominative use, and it is what every
software centre does.

  Zen      app.zen_browser.zen (Flatpak)   MPL-2.0 project
  Firefox  firefox                          Mozilla trademark, used to refer
                                            to Firefox
  Brave    brave-bin                        Brave Software trademark
  Chrome   google-chrome                    Google trademark

These are the vendors' marks, not ours. If any vendor objects, the icon comes
out; the grid does not depend on them.
